2. Foreign Key Constraint Behaviors
Client to Invoice Relationship
* invoices.client_id references clients.id with ON DELETE RESTRICT
* Prevents client deletion if associated invoices exist
* Implementation: ALTER TABLE invoices ADD CONSTRAINT fk_invoices_client FOREIGN KEY (client_id) REFERENCES clients(id) ON DELETE RESTRICT;
* 
Invoice to Invoice Items Relationship
* invoice_items.invoice_id references invoices.id with ON DELETE CASCADE
* Automatically deletes invoice items when parent invoice is deleted
* Implementation: ALTER TABLE invoice_items ADD CONSTRAINT fk_invoice_items_invoice FOREIGN KEY (invoice_id) REFERENCES invoices(id) ON DELETE CASCADE;
* 
Invoice Items to Catalog Items Relationship
* invoice_items.catalog_item_id references catalog_items.id with ON DELETE SET NULL
* When catalog item is deleted, reference in invoice items becomes NULL but invoice item remains
* Implementation: ALTER TABLE invoice_items ADD CONSTRAINT fk_invoice_items_catalog FOREIGN KEY (catalog_item_id) REFERENCES catalog_items(id) ON DELETE SET NULL;
* 
Organization Cascading Deletions
* Organization deletion cascades to all related entities
* Ensures clean removal of all organization data
* Implementation: ALTER TABLE clientsADD CONSTRAINT fk_clients_organizationFOREIGN KEY (organization_id)REFERENCES organizations(id)ON DELETE CASCADE;
* 
3. Unique Constraints
Client ID Uniqueness
* Client IDs must be unique within an organization
* Implementation: ALTER TABLE clients ADD CONSTRAINT unique_client_id_per_org UNIQUE (organization_id, client_id);
* 
Catalog Item Title Uniqueness
* Catalog item titles must be unique within an organization
* Implementation: ALTER TABLE catalog_items ADD CONSTRAINT unique_catalog_title_per_org UNIQUE (organization_id, title);
* 
Invoice ID Uniqueness
* Invoice IDs must be unique within an organization
* Implementation: ALTER TABLE invoices ADD CONSTRAINT unique_invoice_id_per_org UNIQUE (organization_id, invoice_id);
* 
4. Performance Optimization with Indexes
Client Lookup Optimization
* Index on clients(organization_id, client_id) for fast client lookup
* Implementation: CREATE INDEX idx_clients_lookup ON clients(organization_id, client_id);
* 
Invoice Filtering by Status
* Index on invoices(organization_id, status) for efficient status filtering
* Implementation: CREATE INDEX idx_invoices_status ON invoices(organization_id, status);
* 
Invoice Search Optimization
* Index on invoices(organization_id, invoice_id) for ID search
